---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Your Guide | Lemonski Tours — Local ATV Guide, North Country NH"
  description="Meet your Lemonski Tours guide. A local who leads you across New Hampshire's North Country and the Ride the Wilds trails to the views and stories you'd miss on your own."
>
  <section class="page-head section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Meet your guide</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Ride with a local who knows the trail.</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="guide section">
    <div class="guide-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/logo-concepts/recommended-badge.svg" alt="" />
      <span class="stamp">LOCAL<br>GUIDED<br>ADVENTURES</span>
    </div>
    <div class="guide-copy">
      <p class="lead">Lemonski Tours is a guided experience you can add to any ride — whether you're renting locally or bringing your own machine.</p>
      <p>You drive while an easygoing local guide leads you to the good stuff, shares the stories behind the trail, and shapes the day around your group. This isn't a bus tour and it isn't a set script — it's your ride, with someone who knows where the views, the waterfalls, and the worthwhile stops are.</p>
      <p>Every tour is built around your crew and your comfort level, from first-timers to seasoned riders. Tell us the kind of day you want, and we'll make it happen.</p>
      <blockquote>
        “My favorite part is showing someone a place they never would have found on their own.”
        <cite>— James Leeman, your local guide</cite>
      </blockquote>
      <!-- TODO: expand with James's real bio — years riding the North Country,
           favorite trails, what makes a Lemonski tour different. -->
      <div class="page-cta">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/book">Book a ride with your guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
